      "content_body": "Check the third-party vendor's status page for active incidents or deprecation notices. If the vendor is down or has deprecated an endpoint, enable the built-in fallback logic or switch to the legacy API version if available. Engage the vendor support team to confirm the timeline for the breaking change. Document the incident and apply a temporary workaround to prevent cascading failures in the Refund Manager."
