      "content_body": "Verify the transaction history to identify if the overcharge resulted from a duplicate payment attempt or a configuration error. Check for data quality issues in the customer's billing profile that might affect currency conversion. Run the standard data repair script to correct the ledger entries. If the script fails, perform a manual reconciliation and document the discrepancy."
