      "content_body": "Check if the retention policy configuration has been applied to the correct data sets in the Analytics Dashboard. Look for missing consent records or audit log gaps, which may stem from insufficient monitoring alerts. If the issue is a known product limitation, apply the documented workaround. For data quality issues causing residency flag mismatches, use a data repair script to align the metadata."
