      "content_body": "Identify if the issue stems from a bad deployment, dependency failure, or infrastructure hardware problem by checking the orchestration logs. If pods are restarting repeatedly due to OOMKilled status, review resource limits and recent code changes. Execute a rollback if a bad deployment is suspected. For infrastructure failures, initiate a failover or request vendor replacement of the affected nodes."
